    "title": "AI Photo Editor - DoFoto",
    "description": "<b><i>DoFoto is a free all-in-one photo editing app that helps you create stunning photos, pic collages, and unleash unlimited creativity!</i></b>\r\n\r\nAiming at your go-to free Photo Editor, DoFoto features the dazz cam for capturing amazing photos and videos, free AI photo enhancer to better quality, alongside aesthetic photo filters and AI photo effects to edit photos.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n\r\n\u2728<b><i>Useful & Fun AI Tools</i></b>\u2728 \r\n* <b>AI Photo Enhancer</b>: Turn your photos into HD, unblur your precious memories\r\n* <b>Al Cartoon</b>: Create your own avatars with AI art generator\r\n* <b>AI Remove</b>: Remove unwanted objects with offline convenience\r\n* <b>Auto Adjust</b>: Improve your photo tones effortlessly\r\n* <b>Auto Retouch</b>: Blemish remover, teeth whitener, skin smoother, acne remover, wrinkle remover, dark circle remover, perfect your selfies instantly\r\n* <b>Auto BG Remover</b>: Remove background from photos free with AI Cutout\r\n\r\n<b>Live Effects Camera</b>\r\n* Selfie camera with trendy real-time effects and filters\r\n* <b>Take amazing photos and videos</b> with effects camera\r\n* Abundant camera effects: Bling, Stardust, Glitch, VHS Camera Effect, Clone, Digital lines, Four grids, Love bubbles, etc.\r\n\r\n<b>Photo Filters</b>\r\n* Exclusive photo filters, such as Indie, IG, Dark, LOMO, Retro, etc.\r\n* Aesthetic snap photo filters for pictures, and free photo editing app for Instagram sharing\r\n* Fine adjustment for photo filters and effects strength, best picture editor with filters\r\n\r\n<b>AI Photo Effects</b>\r\n* Excellent Glitch effects to enhance your pics, such as VHS, vaporwave etc.\r\n* Amazing snap photo effects, such as Light Leak, Bling, Glow, etc.\r\n* Support <b>separate adjustment of foreground and background photo effects</b>\r\n* Best free AI photo editing app 2023 to make your photos stand out with BG Blur, BG Clone and Glitch\r\n\r\n<b>Advanced Photo Adjustment</b>\r\n* Adjust Brightness, Contrast, Highlights, Warmth, Shadows, Sharpness, Dispersion, Exposure, Vignette editing tool, etc.  All FREE to use\r\n* User-friendly pic editing apps for Android\r\n* Support separate adjustment of foreground and background\r\n\r\n<b>HSL & Curves for FREE</b>\r\n* Free AI photo editor with advanced color adjustment tools: HSL & Curves\r\n* HSL - Easily control Hue, Saturation, Luminance, support multi colors channels, intuitive photo color changer app\r\n* Curves - Precise adjustment with 4 color options\r\n\r\n<b>Background Changer & BG Blur</b>\r\n* Cutout photo with AI Cutout, replace background with custom pics\r\n* One-tap blur your photo background\r\n\r\n<b>Add photo on photo</b>\r\n* Overlay images to create visually compelling design\r\n* Add photo on photo and blend them to create professional <b>Double Exposure</b> effect\r\n\r\n<b>Photo Frames</b>\r\n* Exquisite photo frames to make your photos look like artworks\r\n* Easily share your artwork to Instagram, WhatsApp, Snapchat, etc.\r\n\r\n<b>Text & Stickers</b>\r\n* Add text on photo, with lots of fonts to choose from\r\n* Add exclusive stickers and emoji on photo\r\n\r\n<b>Pic Collage Maker</b>\r\n* Free pic collage maker with 200+ layouts \r\n* Up to 20 photos to create your own photo grid art\r\n* <b>Freestyle</b> collage scrapbooks - use AI Cutout to remove background from all portraits with just one tap!\r\n\r\nNo matter you are a newbie or professional, <b>AI Photo Editor & AI Photo Enhancer - DoFoto</b> will be your best choice of picture editor. Aiming at the best editing app for pictures, DoFoto AI Photo Editor helps you become an expert in photo editing!",
